et me fix both issues now.\n\nLet me also reconsider the analytics service architecture. The current approach has two handlers for ORDER_CREATED and PAYMENT_PROCESSED, which causes issues with handler execution order. Let me consolidate everything into the loop handler to avoid this problem.\n\nActually, the cleanest approach for analytics is to have a single handler per event type and handle everything there. Let me rewrite it.","signature":"ea7bc6f4e86b4f5b99f042a75caf70d6"}],"model":"zai-org/GLM-5.1-FP8","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":33544,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fd81fee0-187e-4e4c-a1be-d6b34a22c525","uuid":"6e7f8c2d-d397-40c8-b7ce-5928cc44c54e"}
